        "id": "RumbleFlameThrower",
        "name": "Flamespitter",
        "description": "Rumble torches opponents in front of him, dealing magic damage in a cone for 3 seconds. While in Danger Zone this damage is increased.",
        "tooltip": "Rumble ignites his flamethrower, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(50/75/100/125/150 + (105% Ability Power)) plus 6/6.5/7/7.5/8% max Health magic damage</span> over 3 seconds, reduced to <span>70%</span> against minions.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Danger Zone:</span> Damage is increased to <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(75/112.5/150/187.5/225 + (157.5% Ability Power)) plus 9/9.75/10.5/11.25/12% max Health</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Percent damage is limited to (65 ~ 300) damage on Monsters. </span>",
